    <description><![CDATA[A beautiful client for Plex & Jellyfin

Stream your media library with HDR, Dolby Vision, offline downloads, and a gorgeous experience across all your devices.

**Features**

- Wide Codec Support
- HDR10+
- Subtitles
- Cross-Platform
- Offline
- Watch Together
- Tracker Sync
- Skip intros
- Chapter support
- Gestures
]]></description>
    <summary>A modern client for Plex and Jellyfin on desktop, mobile, and TV. Built with Flutter for native performance and a clean interface.</summary>
    <releaseNotes><![CDATA[[Releases](https://github.com/edde746/plezy/releases)

## New features

- Multi-version movies and episodes get a split Play button
- Player changes can be saved globally, per library, per show or movie, or not at all
- Search results show their source server and library
- Plex artist pages group albums by release type
- Connected MDBList watchlists can be selected in Explore
- iOS and tvOS system video controls add skip buttons

## Playback

- Video starts faster through cached metadata and parallelized setup
- Play actions show loading feedback during fetches
- Network prefetching removes gaps between music tracks
- ExoPlayer seeks correctly in MKVs with late track metadata
- Android MPV renders software-decoded Dolby Vision correctly
- Compatible Android routes can bitstream DTS-HD MA
- Android falls back to FFmpeg DTS decoding when passthrough is unavailable
- Android passthrough only enables compatible audio routes
- Plex Live TV can select and burn embedded DVB subtitles
- Right-arrow focus reaches the last player control
- Timed-out endpoint probes close promptly

## Music

- Plex playlists prefer user-assigned posters
- Album and playlist grids have consistent card spacing

## Plex & Live TV

- Live TV guide reloads preserve focus and apply day picks immediately
- Older Plex servers regain show logos in Continue Watching

## TV & profiles

- D-pad navigation preserves collection and playlist grid positions
- Closing Fire TV system overlays no longer reopens the profile picker

## UI & translations

- Sheet Back-button hover circles are centered
- Missing translations are filled; unused keys are removed

## tvOS

- Apple TV Direct Play no longer develops recurring stutter or passthrough dropouts

## macOS

- Audio falls back to AVFoundation when CoreAudio fails
- The nonfunctional audio-passthrough option is removed

## Windows

- HDR letterbox bars render true black

## Linux

- Wayland playback no longer crashes with software GL]]></releaseNotes>
